# Project: web-security26 | Lab: 6 | File: annotations.http

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tracks

### 1. @PreAuthorize permits ADMIN - 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/hello/admin
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Accept: application/json

### 2. @PreAuthorize rejects USER - 403
GET {{baseUrl}}/hello/admin
Authorization: Basic user user
Accept: application/json

### 3. @PreAuthorize permits USER - 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/hello/user
Authorization: Basic user user
Accept: application/json

### 4. @PreAuthorize rejects ADMIN - 403
GET {{baseUrl}}/hello/user
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Accept: application/json

### 5. hasAnyRole permits ADMIN - 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/hello/member
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Accept: application/json

### 6. hasAnyRole permits USER - 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/hello/member
Authorization: Basic user user
Accept: application/json

### 7. @PreAuthorize permits SUPERADMIN - 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/hello/superadmin
Authorization: Basic superadmin superadmin
Accept: application/json

### 8. @PreAuthorize rejects ADMIN - 403
GET {{baseUrl}}/hello/superadmin
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Accept: application/json

### 9. Authenticated route without method annotation - 200
GET {{baseUrl}}
Authorization: Basic user user
Accept: application/json

### 10. Authentication is still required before method security - 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/hello/member
Accept: application/json
